---
import { atlasStatistics, statisticsSources } from '../../data/atlas/statistics';
const receipts=atlasStatistics.national.cashReceipts,[crops,livestock]=receipts.groups,trade=atlasStatistics.national.trade.series,lastTrade=trade.at(-1)!;
const totalBillion=receipts.totalThousandUsd/1_000_000, groupShare=(v:number)=>v/receipts.totalThousandUsd*100, itemShare=(v:number,p:number)=>v/p*100;
const x=(i:number)=>25+i*(310/(trade.length-1)),y=(v:number)=>119-((v-110)/110)*94;
const exportPoints=trade.map((e,i)=>`${x(i).toFixed(1)},${y(e.exports).toFixed(1)}`).join(' '),importPoints=trade.map((e,i)=>`${x(i).toFixed(1)},${y(e.imports).toFixed(1)}`).join(' ');
const farmSource=statisticsSources.find(e=>e.id==='source-usda-farm-income')!,tradeSource=statisticsSources.find(e=>e.id==='source-usda-fatus-calendar')!;
---
<aside class="atlas-national" aria-labelledby="national-agriculture-title" data-national-summary>
 <header><p class="atlas-eyebrow">NATIONAL OVERVIEW</p><h2 id="national-agriculture-title">米国の農業</h2><p>販売収入は畜産が56%、作物が44%。作物ではとうもろこしと大豆、畜産では牛・子牛と家禽・卵が大きな柱です。</p></header>
 <figure class="atlas-mini-chart atlas-receipts-chart">
  <figcaption><strong>農畜産物の販売収入</strong><span>2025年推計</span></figcaption>
  <div class="atlas-parent-bar" role="img" aria-label={`販売収入約${totalBillion.toFixed(0)}0億ドルのうち作物${groupShare(crops.totalThousandUsd).toFixed(0)}%、畜産${groupShare(livestock.totalThousandUsd).toFixed(0)}%`}>
   <span class="is-crops" style={`width:${groupShare(crops.totalThousandUsd)}%`}><b>作物</b><strong>{groupShare(crops.totalThousandUsd).toFixed(0)}%</strong></span><span class="is-livestock" style={`width:${groupShare(livestock.totalThousandUsd)}%`}><b>畜産</b><strong>{groupShare(livestock.totalThousandUsd).toFixed(0)}%</strong></span>
  </div><p class="atlas-chart-total">全品目　<strong>{totalBillion.toFixed(1)}</strong> 十億ドル</p>
  <div class="atlas-receipt-groups">{receipts.groups.map(group=><section class={`atlas-receipt-group is-${group.id}`} aria-labelledby={`receipt-${group.id}`}><h3 id={`receipt-${group.id}`}>{group.label}内の割合 <span>{(group.totalThousandUsd/1_000_000).toFixed(1)} 十億ドル</span></h3><div class="atlas-bars">{group.items.map(entry=><div class="atlas-bar-row"><span>{entry.label}</span><i><b style={`width:${itemShare(entry.valueThousandUsd,group.totalThousandUsd)/50*100}%`}></b></i><strong>{itemShare(entry.valueThousandUsd,group.totalThousandUsd).toFixed(1)}%</strong></div>)}</div></section>)}</div>
  <details class="atlas-receipt-definitions"><summary>金額と分類の定義</summary><p>販売による現金収入。利益・生産量・GDPではありません。作物内の「その他」はUSDA原統計の一括分類です。畜産には養殖等の小分類も含みます。</p><table><thead><tr><th>分類</th><th>10億ドル</th></tr></thead><tbody>{receipts.groups.flatMap(group=>group.items).map(entry=><tr><th>{entry.label}</th><td>{(entry.valueThousandUsd/1_000_000).toFixed(1)}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></details>
  <a href={farmSource.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">出典：USDA ERS</a>
 </figure>
 <figure class="atlas-mini-chart atlas-trade-chart"><figcaption><strong>農産物の輸出・輸入</strong><span>暦年・名目10億ドル</span></figcaption><svg viewBox="0 0 360 145" role="img" aria-labelledby="national-trade-title national-trade-desc"><title id="national-trade-title">2016年から2025年の米国農産物輸出額と輸入額</title><desc id="national-trade-desc">輸出は2016年138.9、2025年171.4。輸入は2016年122.6、2025年212.1、単位は10億ドルです。</desc>{[120,160,200].map(v=><g><line x1="25" y1={y(v)} x2="335" y2={y(v)}></line><text x="2" y={y(v)+4}>{v}</text></g>)}<polyline class="atlas-line atlas-line--export" points={exportPoints}></polyline><polyline class="atlas-line atlas-line--import" points={importPoints}></polyline><circle class="atlas-dot atlas-dot--export" cx={x(trade.length-1)} cy={y(lastTrade.exports)} r="3"></circle><circle class="atlas-dot atlas-dot--import" cx={x(trade.length-1)} cy={y(lastTrade.imports)} r="3"></circle><text class="atlas-line-label atlas-line-label--import" x="331" y={y(lastTrade.imports)-7} text-anchor="end">輸入 {lastTrade.imports.toFixed(1)}</text><text class="atlas-line-label atlas-line-label--export" x="331" y={y(lastTrade.exports)+14} text-anchor="end">輸出 {lastTrade.exports.toFixed(1)}</text><text x="25" y="141">2016</text><text x="335" y="141" text-anchor="end">2025</text></svg><p class="atlas-chart-note">2025年は輸入が輸出を約{(lastTrade.imports-lastTrade.exports).toFixed(1)}十億ドル上回りました。</p><div class="atlas-line-key" aria-hidden="true"><span><i class="is-export"></i>輸出</span><span><i class="is-import"></i>輸入</span></div><a href={tradeSource.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">出典：USDA ERS FATUS</a><details><summary>数値表</summary><table><thead><tr><th>年</th><th>輸出</th><th>輸入</th></tr></thead><tbody>{trade.map(e=><tr><th>{e.year}</th><td>{e.exports.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{e.imports.toFixed(1)}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></details></figure>
</aside>
